msgid "Biz Haqimizda"
msgstr "About Us"

msgid ""
"HR-Pro — O'zbekiston kompaniyalari uchun ishlab chiqilgan zamonaviy HR "
"platformasi. Kadrlar bo'limining kundalik ishlarini avtomatlashtiring."
msgstr ""
"HR-Pro — A modern HR platform designed for Uzbekistan companies. "
"Automate your HR department's daily tasks."

msgid "Kompaniya haqida"
msgstr "About the company"

msgid "HR jarayonlarini"
msgstr "HR processes"

msgid "soddalashtirish missiyasi"
msgstr "simplification mission"

msgid ""
"HR-Pro — O'zbekiston kompaniyalari uchun maxsus ishlab chiqilgan zamonaviy "
"kadrlar boshqaruv platformasi. Biz HR bo'limining kundalik vazifalarini "
"avtomatlashtirib, vaqtingizni tejashga yordam beramiz."
msgstr ""
"HR-Pro — A modern HR management platform specially developed for Uzbekistan "
"companies. We help you save time by automating the daily tasks of your HR "
"department."

msgid "Missiyamiz"
msgstr "Our Mission"

msgid ""
"O'zbekiston kompaniyalariga HR jarayonlarini avtomatlashtirish orqali "
"samaradorlikni oshirish. Kadrlar bo'limining kundalik ishlarini "
"soddalashtirish va xodimlar bilan ishlashni yangi bosqichga olib chiqish."
msgstr ""
"Increase efficiency by automating HR processes for Uzbekistan companies. "
"Simplify the daily work of the HR department and take employee management "
"to the next level."

msgid "Maqsadimiz"
msgstr "Our Goal"

msgid ""
"O'zbekistonda yetakchi HR platformasiga aylanish. Mahalliy kompaniyalar "
"ehtiyojlarini chuqur tushunadigan va ularga mos yechimlar taqdim etadigan "
"ishonchli texnologik hamkorga aylanish."
msgstr ""
"To become the leading HR platform in Uzbekistan. To become a trusted "
"technology partner that deeply understands the needs of local companies "
"and provides suitable solutions."

msgid "Afzalliklar"
msgstr "Advantages"

msgid "Nima uchun"
msgstr "Why"

msgid "Bizni tanlashingiz uchun asosiy sabablar"
msgstr "Key reasons to choose us"

msgid "Mahalliy yechim"
msgstr "Local solution"

msgid ""
"O'zbekiston bozori va qonunchiligini yaxshi bilamiz. Platforma mahalliy "
"ehtiyojlarga to'liq moslashtirilgan va o'zbek tilida ishlaydi."
msgstr ""
"We know the Uzbekistan market and legislation well. The platform is fully "
"adapted to local needs and works in Uzbek."

msgid "Tez va oson"
msgstr "Fast and easy"

msgid ""
"3 daqiqada ro'yxatdan o'ting va ishni boshlang. Murakkab o'rnatish yoki "
"texnik bilim talab qilinmaydi. Intuitiv interfeys."
msgstr ""
"Sign up in 3 minutes and start working. No complex installation or "
"technical knowledge required. Intuitive interface."

msgid "Doimo yoningizda"
msgstr "Always with you"

msgid ""
"24/7 texnik yordam. Har qanday savol yoki muammoda tezkor yordam beramiz. "
"Telegram orqali doimiy aloqadamiz."
msgstr ""
"24/7 technical support. We provide prompt assistance with any question or "
"problem. Always in touch via Telegram."

